## Model card

- **Name:** Grok 5
- **Short description:** xAI next flagship MoE (6T/10T rumored), in training on Colossus 2 since Jan 2026. Positioned as potential frontier leader above Grok 4.x; unreleased as of Oct 2026.
- **Provider / access:** xAI (expected xAI API `grok-5`, X Premium+). No public API ID live as of 2026-10-02. Chat Completions expected.
- **Release / knowledge:** Unreleased — in active training per xAI Series E Jan 2026; Q1/Q2 2026 windows slipped, no official date. Knowledge cutoff unknown.
- **IDs:** `grok-5` (expected; no verified live provider ID found)
- **Context window:** Undisclosed — no verified total / max output found; do not copy Grok 4.7 500K or Grok 4.20 2M figures
- **Modalities:** Undisclosed — expected text/image in; no verified modality list found
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-02):** No public per-token price found; tiered SuperGrok speculation only — not scored
- **Architecture:** 6T (and rumored 10T variant) MoE on Colossus 2 supercluster per kie.ai/xAI reports; proprietary, weights private

